WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:49.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:50.040 --> 01:50.840
Did it go smoothly?

3
01:52.280 --> 01:53.680
This Cheng Weimin...

4
01:55.000 --> 01:56.920
used to be Xiang Nan's downline.

5
01:57.400 --> 01:58.000
Now,

6
01:58.000 --> 01:59.359
he wants to bring his own clients

7
01:59.359 --> 02:00.799
and partner with us.

8
02:01.400 --> 02:02.280
But if he does that,

9
02:03.519 --> 02:05.159
Xiang Nan definitely won't let him off.

10
02:07.000 --> 02:07.760
So,

11
02:09.000 --> 02:11.919
he wants to use us to eliminate Xiang Nan.

12
02:15.800 --> 02:17.919
Xiang Nan is backed by Piyazi, though.

13
02:18.199 --> 02:21.400
The reason Cheng Weimin wants our help

14
02:21.400 --> 02:22.560
to get rid of Xiang Nan

15
02:22.639 --> 02:23.639
is that he's afraid later on,

16
02:23.680 --> 02:26.120
Piyazi will come after him alone.

17
02:26.599 --> 02:29.199
Now that he's reached out to us,

18
02:29.599 --> 02:32.000
both Jiang Liye and Theerade

19
02:32.439 --> 02:33.800
will become his backing.

20
02:38.400 --> 02:39.879
If we cause such a massive stir,

21
02:40.039 --> 02:41.840
won't Mr. Theerade be displeased?

22
02:44.120 --> 02:44.800
Hard to say.

23
02:45.159 --> 02:47.120
Still, I think Theerade and Piyazi

24
02:47.319 --> 02:48.960
are completely at odds.

25
02:49.280 --> 02:49.919
Otherwise,

26
02:51.000 --> 02:52.439
he wouldn't be working with us.

27
02:55.080 --> 02:58.000
Cheng Weimin is right about one thing, though:

28
02:58.199 --> 03:01.439
Xiang Nan is our common enemy.

29
03:03.719 --> 03:04.879
Let's go. We'll talk in the car.

30
03:57.280 --> 03:57.759
Brother Nan.

31
03:59.000 --> 04:00.159
Bring Yang Xing up.

32
04:18.879 --> 04:19.439
Let go.

33
04:31.920 --> 04:32.439
Don't move.

34
04:36.360 --> 04:37.720
Once we get there,

35
04:37.959 --> 04:39.439
if Cheng Weimin doesn't show up,

36
04:39.680 --> 04:41.279
call him for me

37
04:43.839 --> 04:45.279
and lure him out.

38
04:48.560 --> 04:49.079
Got it.

39
04:49.240 --> 04:50.920
I'm on Brother Nan's side now.

40
04:51.120 --> 04:52.439
I'll definitely do what Brother Nan says.

41
04:53.160 --> 04:53.680
Let's go.

42
05:19.040 --> 05:20.480
We're already on our way.

43
05:20.879 --> 05:21.720
Where are your men?

44
05:21.879 --> 05:22.639
Are they ready?

45
05:24.360 --> 05:24.839
Good.

46
05:26.160 --> 05:27.199
Don't worry.

47
05:28.000 --> 05:28.920
Once it's done,

48
05:28.959 --> 05:29.879
I'll wire the rest of the money

49
05:29.879 --> 05:31.319
straight to your account.

50
05:32.199 --> 05:32.879
No need.

51
05:34.399 --> 05:36.279
Your men only need to handle the others.

52
05:36.639 --> 05:38.560
As for Cheng Weimin,

53
05:39.839 --> 05:41.600
he must die by my men's hands.

54
05:42.680 --> 05:43.160
Fine.

55
07:34.040 --> 07:35.160
Ma Jingrong and Cheng Weimin

56
07:35.600 --> 07:36.839
are both heinous criminals.

57
07:39.560 --> 07:40.360
Plus, now there's that

58
07:40.480 --> 07:41.839
cold-blooded killer Xiang Nan.

59
07:43.240 --> 07:44.079
I'm worried...

60
07:47.319 --> 07:50.079
It's a simple mission. Don't worry.

61
08:09.560 --> 08:10.079
Xiao Zhuang,

62
08:13.360 --> 08:14.199
you must be careful.

63
08:14.959 --> 08:15.720
Don't worry.

64
08:15.920 --> 08:17.720
I'll definitely bring him back in one piece.

65
08:27.360 --> 08:28.120
Wait for me.

66
08:56.559 --> 08:58.759
After spending so much time with the two of you,

67
08:59.759 --> 09:01.159
I feel a real sense of closeness.

68
09:02.240 --> 09:04.519
Siqi once told me in private

69
09:05.960 --> 09:07.200
that when the time was right,

70
09:07.759 --> 09:08.919
we'd go abroad together

71
09:08.960 --> 09:11.600
and live like a real family.

72
09:13.360 --> 09:15.320
All right. Let's go abroad together.

73
09:37.759 --> 09:38.360
Xiao Zhuang,

74
09:40.840 --> 09:41.679
today...

75
09:42.600 --> 09:44.159
this is no ordinary operation.

76
09:44.639 --> 09:46.039
I know you can handle yourself,

77
09:46.279 --> 09:50.279
but stay clear if things go wrong.

78
09:50.759 --> 09:52.200
If anything happens to you,

79
09:54.600 --> 09:56.720
I won't be able to face your wife.

80
09:57.639 --> 09:58.440
Stay clear?

81
09:59.519 --> 10:00.600
Can I really stay clear?

82
10:01.679 --> 10:02.759
Cheng Weimin...

83
10:02.960 --> 10:05.320
doesn't he just want Xiang Nan dead by our hands?

84
10:06.720 --> 10:08.200
Even so, you don't have to do it yourself.

85
10:09.440 --> 10:10.679
I don't want Piyazi

86
10:10.960 --> 10:12.879
to pin Xiang Nan's death on you.

87
10:15.120 --> 10:16.000
I'm different.

88
10:17.120 --> 10:19.720
Sooner or later, I'll have to face Piyazi anyway.

89
10:49.919 --> 10:50.879
How are things, Mr. Cheng?

90
10:51.799 --> 10:52.480
Everything is ready.

91
10:52.639 --> 10:55.279
Xiang Nan will never guess

92
10:55.320 --> 10:56.840
that so many people are looking for me today.

93
10:57.320 --> 10:59.039
He should already be on his way.

94
10:59.480 --> 11:00.480
We should head out, too.

95
11:00.759 --> 11:01.279
All right.

96
11:21.120 --> 11:22.679
Ma Jingrong and Cheng Weimin have agreed

97
11:22.799 --> 11:24.039
to eliminate Xiang Nan together.

98
11:24.200 --> 11:24.919
Meanwhile, on Xiang Nan's side,

99
11:25.000 --> 11:27.039
he wants to use Yang Xing to lure Cheng Weimin out.

100
11:28.000 --> 11:29.279
This isn't a deal.

101
11:29.559 --> 11:30.360
It's a firefight.

102
11:30.559 --> 11:32.720
Operation Thunderbolt's Chief Liaison Bai Hua

103
11:32.879 --> 11:34.360
is the overall commander for our operation.

104
11:35.480 --> 11:37.080
Captain Bai will assess the scene,

105
11:37.200 --> 11:38.279
and to Team A, led by me,

106
11:38.440 --> 11:39.720
Team B, led by Zhang Qiang,

107
11:40.159 --> 11:41.799
and Team C, comprising SWAT officers,

108
11:41.879 --> 11:42.519
issue all operational orders.

109
11:42.919 --> 11:43.360
Captain Bai.

110
11:46.080 --> 11:47.240
According to instructions from our superiors,

111
11:47.480 --> 11:48.399
for this operation,

112
11:48.559 --> 11:50.440
our primary capture target is Cheng Weimin.

113
11:51.279 --> 11:52.960
As for Ma Jingrong and Xiang Nan,

114
11:53.200 --> 11:55.159
during the course of the operation,

115
11:55.320 --> 11:57.000
we need to create favorable conditions

116
11:57.120 --> 11:58.000
so that we can let them get away,

117
11:58.159 --> 11:59.440
in order to ensure Operation Thunderbolt

118
11:59.679 --> 12:00.679
can proceed smoothly.

119
12:01.679 --> 12:02.879
Because today's operation

120
12:02.919 --> 12:04.000
is of a unique and sensitive nature,

121
12:04.159 --> 12:06.639
please make sure all officers are notified

122
12:06.759 --> 12:08.639
to remain on high alert

123
12:08.960 --> 12:11.679
and follow my orders during the mission.

124
12:14.159 --> 12:16.120
If we're all set, let's move out.

125
13:15.320 --> 13:17.480
You're the star of the show today.

126
13:28.399 --> 13:30.559
Once Yuan Hong captures Cheng Weimin,

127
13:30.679 --> 13:32.799
I'll make him hand over the client files.

128
13:33.919 --> 13:35.440
Then you kill him.

129
14:03.200 --> 14:04.480
Call Boss Cheng.

130
14:04.919 --> 14:05.399
Got it.

131
14:29.960 --> 14:30.600
Boss Cheng.

132
14:31.240 --> 14:33.399
Boss Yang, long time no see.

133
14:34.039 --> 14:34.600
Long time no see.

134
14:42.960 --> 14:44.120
Counting this shipment,

135
14:44.360 --> 14:46.039
you owe me 1.8 million in total.

136
14:48.039 --> 14:48.759
Where's my money?

137
14:50.759 --> 14:51.679
The money's in my car.

138
14:51.960 --> 14:53.440
I'll have someone bring it over now.

139
14:59.639 --> 15:00.360
Bring the money over.

140
15:02.039 --> 15:02.639
Drive.

141
15:08.440 --> 15:08.879
Be right there.

142
15:31.840 --> 15:34.679
Brother Nan, what are you doing here?

143
15:35.279 --> 15:37.360
Long time no see, brother.

144
15:37.919 --> 15:39.159
I've really missed you.

145
15:39.799 --> 15:41.679
Brother Nan, don't say that.

146
15:41.919 --> 15:43.519
You're scaring me.

147
15:44.000 --> 15:45.279
I'm terrified.

148
15:49.159 --> 15:50.759
Have you always wanted to see me

149
15:50.759 --> 15:52.080
looking this terrified?

150
15:53.000 --> 15:54.360
Did you really think

151
15:54.480 --> 15:55.360
that in front of you,

152
15:55.360 --> 15:57.000
I, Cheng Weimin, am just a nobody?

153
15:58.799 --> 16:00.600
Bringing just two guys to kill me?

154
16:01.440 --> 16:02.879
Do you think I'm stupid?

155
16:15.080 --> 16:16.320
Ma Jingrong.

156
16:17.399 --> 16:18.240
Don't be surprised.

157
16:18.919 --> 16:20.480
Didn't you want to kill me?

158
16:20.559 --> 16:21.279
Here I am.

159
16:41.000 --> 16:42.519
I bet you never thought

160
16:42.840 --> 16:44.519
you'd fall into our hands, did you?

161
16:48.600 --> 16:50.879
I really underestimated you.

162
16:51.679 --> 16:53.720
But it's too early to tell who'll win.

163
16:54.120 --> 16:55.240
Ladies and gentlemen,

164
17:13.759 --> 17:14.559
All units, be advised.

165
17:15.000 --> 17:17.440
Both groups of suspects have now appeared.

166
17:17.599 --> 17:18.799
Team C, prepare to move.

167
17:18.839 --> 17:19.279
Copy that.

168
17:23.880 --> 17:25.400
Give me Team C's full area map.

169
17:25.480 --> 17:25.799
Yes, sir.

170
17:45.039 --> 17:46.640
Looks like with the way things stand,

171
17:46.680 --> 17:49.119
the odds aren't really in your favor.

172
17:50.359 --> 17:53.480
How about this: hand over the client files,

173
17:53.839 --> 17:55.039
and we'll go our separate ways.

174
17:55.119 --> 17:56.880
I know you all too well.

175
17:57.400 --> 17:58.680
At worst, we all go down together.

176
17:59.079 --> 18:01.000
Let's see who walks out of here alive today!

177
18:11.799 --> 18:13.240
Team C, move in.

178
18:41.880 --> 18:43.119
The cops are here! Let's go!

179
18:57.359 --> 18:58.640
Xiao Zhuang, run!

180
19:38.640 --> 19:40.079
You are surrounded by police!

181
19:40.440 --> 19:42.640
Drop your weapons and surrender!

182
19:55.200 --> 19:55.839
Captain Bai! Captain Bai!

183
19:56.880 --> 19:58.039
Brother Nan, get in!

184
20:01.279 --> 20:02.400
Out of the way!

185
20:26.519 --> 20:27.680
Brother Ma, head upstairs.

186
20:53.920 --> 20:54.759
Brother Ma, let's go!

187
21:07.400 --> 21:07.759
Let's go.

188
21:41.319 --> 21:42.680
Brother Ma, run!

189
21:42.759 --> 21:43.240
Go!

190
22:01.119 --> 22:01.880
Put the gun down!

191
22:03.599 --> 22:04.200
Drop the gun!

192
22:04.559 --> 22:05.160
Don't move!

193
22:09.880 --> 22:10.480
Drop your weapon!

194
22:23.119 --> 22:23.559
Captain Bai,

195
22:24.240 --> 22:25.400
Ma Jingrong and Four-Legged Snake

196
22:25.400 --> 22:27.119
have escaped through the exit we arranged.

197
22:28.640 --> 22:29.240
Keep up the pursuit.

198
22:29.319 --> 22:30.480
Don't make it too easy for them.

199
22:31.000 --> 22:31.519
Copy that.

200
22:56.359 --> 22:56.839
Keep chasing them!

201
22:56.880 --> 22:57.319
Yes, sir!

202
23:02.599 --> 23:03.440
We're by the river right now.

203
23:04.880 --> 23:07.079
Meet us at the Oasis Avenue intersection in a bit.

204
23:07.480 --> 23:07.880
Got it.

205
23:09.960 --> 23:10.920
Who are you calling?

206
23:10.920 --> 23:11.440
Xiaobai.

207
23:12.640 --> 23:13.480
Brother Ma, look out!

208
23:53.079 --> 23:53.559
Captain Bai.

209
23:54.319 --> 23:54.799
Director Yan.

210
23:55.079 --> 23:55.839
How is the situation?

211
23:56.119 --> 23:57.440
Today's operation went very smoothly.

212
23:57.680 --> 23:59.960
Operation Thunderbolt should be able to move forward.

213
24:05.359 --> 24:05.720
Reporting:

214
24:06.279 --> 24:07.599
Seven suspects were killed on-site,

215
24:07.720 --> 24:09.480
and six injured, including Cheng Weimin.

216
24:09.640 --> 24:10.640
Ma Jingrong and Xiang Nan

217
24:10.720 --> 24:11.599
escaped with two others.

218
24:11.720 --> 24:13.000
Zero casualties on our side.

219
24:14.440 --> 24:14.960
Good.

220
24:19.839 --> 24:21.279
In the earlier Nanhai drug case,

221
24:21.279 --> 24:23.200
many questions remain unanswered.

222
24:23.440 --> 24:25.720
Cheng Weimin must be

223
24:25.759 --> 24:26.400
the key to unraveling them.

224
24:30.119 --> 24:31.799
I'll have officers keep eyes on him at the hospital.

225
24:32.200 --> 24:34.359
We'll interrogate him once he's out of danger.

226
24:34.680 --> 24:35.400
Thank you, Director Yan.

227
24:38.319 --> 24:39.400
You rascal,

228
24:39.400 --> 24:41.359
had your fill of living out a Hollywood blockbuster today?

229
24:43.680 --> 24:45.200
I only watch domestic cop films.

230
24:46.160 --> 24:46.680
Captain Bai.

231
24:59.160 --> 25:00.319
Weren't you going to meet the buyer?

232
25:00.319 --> 25:01.519
How did it end up like this?

233
25:02.559 --> 25:04.160
The cops are looking for us. Let's talk inside.

234
25:04.519 --> 25:06.200
I told you not to come back.

235
25:06.720 --> 25:08.319
It's fine. Nothing happened anyway.

236
25:10.240 --> 25:13.160
Tonight, we'll switch hotels under new identities.

237
25:15.920 --> 25:17.559
Someone on Cheng Weimin's end

238
25:17.759 --> 25:18.559
must have screwed up.

239
25:20.039 --> 25:22.720
I told you before the cops were after him.

240
25:23.000 --> 25:24.680
Working with him was too risky.

241
25:25.160 --> 25:25.720
You're right.

242
25:27.200 --> 25:27.920
That's on me.

243
25:28.160 --> 25:29.400
I was too impatient.

244
25:30.599 --> 25:32.519
Now that Cheng Weimin is in police hands,

245
25:32.680 --> 25:35.000
a lot of people in his network will go down.

246
25:37.240 --> 25:38.160
Looks like on this trip,

247
25:40.119 --> 25:42.079
we won't finish the mission Theerade gave us.

248
25:42.559 --> 25:45.319
I think we need to take this business slow.

249
25:46.119 --> 25:48.240
What worries me most now is Xiang Nan.

250
25:49.279 --> 25:50.279
If he finds out

251
25:51.119 --> 25:53.160
we allied with Cheng Weimin against him,

252
25:53.599 --> 25:54.480
then tracking us down

253
25:54.759 --> 25:55.920
will be a piece of cake for him.

254
25:59.000 --> 26:01.319
Don't worry. Everything is under control.

255
26:34.039 --> 26:35.359
The police will find us soon.

256
26:35.680 --> 26:36.920
We need to get back to Country M fast.

257
26:38.559 --> 26:40.359
We should've taken out Ma Jingrong sooner.

258
26:41.240 --> 26:43.119
Didn't expect him to strike first.

259
26:43.359 --> 26:45.519
The cops have probably busted all of them by now.

260
26:47.200 --> 26:49.640
They're lucky to end up in police hands.

261
27:10.480 --> 27:12.480
There's something I find strange.

262
27:14.200 --> 27:16.000
I only agreed with Cheng Weimin

263
27:16.160 --> 27:17.319
on the meeting place this morning.

264
27:18.319 --> 27:20.440
How did the cops find out so fast?

265
27:21.000 --> 27:22.599
Cheng Weimin has so many men under him.

266
27:22.839 --> 27:24.599
There might be a police mole among them.

267
27:25.400 --> 27:27.240
You've got a point.

268
27:28.359 --> 27:29.599
But I've also been wondering...

269
27:30.359 --> 27:31.640
Could this mole you're talking about

270
27:31.799 --> 27:33.240
be one of us?

271
27:34.200 --> 27:35.039
You suspect Brother Four?

272
27:35.559 --> 27:36.400
No way.

273
27:37.559 --> 27:39.400
Four-Legged Snake has blood on his hands.

274
27:39.720 --> 27:41.000
How could it be him?

275
27:41.440 --> 27:42.920
Did I ever tell you

276
27:43.839 --> 27:45.279
that I used to be a mercenary?

277
27:47.119 --> 27:48.799
No wonder you're so skilled, Brother Nan.

278
27:49.400 --> 27:51.279
Then did I ever tell you

279
27:52.680 --> 27:55.279
that I know Morse code pretty well, too?

280
28:06.319 --> 28:08.119
Looks like I should be thanking you.

281
28:08.680 --> 28:10.480
The only reason I escaped today

282
28:10.480 --> 28:11.759
was because the cops wanted you

283
28:11.920 --> 28:13.200
to stay undercover by my side,

284
28:13.319 --> 28:15.480
so you could get close to my boss, right?

285
28:31.400 --> 28:33.480
How much does a cop make a month?

286
28:33.880 --> 28:34.720
Risking your life like this...

287
28:35.240 --> 28:36.000
Is it worth it?

288
28:36.240 --> 28:37.359
I don't want to risk my life either.

289
28:37.640 --> 28:39.000
But if my life

290
28:39.680 --> 28:42.359
means fewer scumbags like you in this world,

291
28:42.720 --> 28:43.799
even if I die,

292
28:44.279 --> 28:45.279
it'll all be worth it.

293
28:50.559 --> 28:53.319
Go on, shoot!

294
28:53.799 --> 28:55.519
At this speed, the moment you fire,

295
28:55.680 --> 28:56.480
this car will spin out of control.

296
28:56.799 --> 28:58.880
If you don't die, you'll be crippled.

297
28:59.119 --> 29:01.119
The police will definitely catch you.

298
29:06.759 --> 29:10.000
100 million. We go our separate ways.

299
29:18.079 --> 29:19.000
You're right.

300
29:19.960 --> 29:21.480
Cops don't make much money.

301
29:21.680 --> 29:24.440
We undercover cops risk life and limb,

302
29:25.039 --> 29:26.319
on edge every single day.

303
29:26.480 --> 29:27.400
One single slip-up,

304
29:27.559 --> 29:29.319
and we could die at the hands of our own men.

305
29:29.680 --> 29:30.839
But there is one thing

306
29:31.960 --> 29:34.079
that remains an absolute truth:

307
29:35.440 --> 29:36.480
Cops catch criminals.

308
29:37.319 --> 29:38.480
Plain and simple.

309
30:13.839 --> 30:15.200
The cops are here! Let's go!

310
30:57.039 --> 30:58.319
Actually, you didn't kill Xiang Nan

311
30:59.599 --> 31:01.359
just to work with Cheng Weimin,

312
31:01.359 --> 31:01.799
did you?

313
31:05.559 --> 31:07.359
All my brothers in Nanhai

314
31:07.680 --> 31:09.599
died at Xiang Nan's hands.

315
31:12.119 --> 31:14.359
If that mad dog stayed alive,

316
31:15.200 --> 31:17.119
he'd never stop coming after me.

317
31:37.720 --> 31:39.240
Alright, got it.

318
31:41.880 --> 31:42.319
No.

319
31:44.039 --> 31:45.039
Get out of here right now.

320
31:45.319 --> 31:47.200
Come back once we take care of business.

321
31:49.480 --> 31:50.079
Okay.

322
31:58.000 --> 32:01.400
Lao Qin took care of Xiang Nan cleanly.

323
32:02.400 --> 32:05.279
From now on, in Jiangyang,

324
32:05.839 --> 32:08.920
no one can stop me.

325
32:17.279 --> 32:19.079
When did you notify Lao Qin?

326
32:31.480 --> 32:33.599
The day after meeting Cheng Weimin,

327
32:37.000 --> 32:38.680
I was just worried that

328
32:39.799 --> 32:43.240
if the warehouse wasn't fully cleaned up,

329
32:43.880 --> 32:45.359
it'd come back to bite us.

330
32:46.440 --> 32:49.200
With Lao Qin there, I feel at ease.

331
32:56.640 --> 32:58.359
It's not that I don't trust you, Xiao Zhuang.

332
32:58.720 --> 33:01.400
I just don't want you getting involved in this.

333
33:06.279 --> 33:07.599
If you see me as a brother,

334
33:08.200 --> 33:09.440
you shouldn't hide anything from me.

335
33:14.640 --> 33:16.640
Fine, I promise you.

336
33:29.440 --> 33:31.200
The Jiangyang police are investigating us right now.

337
33:31.359 --> 33:32.680
Should we head back and lay low for a while?

338
33:35.640 --> 33:37.680
Theerade expects us to bring clients back with us.

339
33:37.880 --> 33:39.359
Right now, we're empty-handed.

340
33:40.160 --> 33:41.599
We won't be able to answer to him.

341
33:46.400 --> 33:50.960
Too bad Cheng Weimin fell into police hands.

342
33:54.880 --> 33:55.559
Xiao Zhuang.

343
33:56.839 --> 34:01.359
You said you had some friends in Jiangyang too.

344
34:04.319 --> 34:05.640
I wouldn't really call them friends.

345
34:05.839 --> 34:07.119
Just people I've dealt with in business.

346
34:07.559 --> 34:08.599
But through them,

347
34:08.760 --> 34:10.559
we should be able to find the people we need.

348
34:13.079 --> 34:15.920
Brother Ma, you're wanted by the police right now.

349
34:16.519 --> 34:17.679
They shouldn't be onto me yet.

350
34:18.119 --> 34:20.199
So just stay put here for now.

351
34:20.519 --> 34:22.960
Xiaobai and I will handle the clients.

352
34:25.039 --> 34:27.280
Didn't your wife want you out of this business?

353
34:28.039 --> 34:29.039
If she really didn't want me to,

354
34:29.199 --> 34:30.320
she wouldn't have come here with me.

355
34:31.039 --> 34:32.400
That's the power of love.

356
34:35.679 --> 34:36.440
Be careful.

357
34:37.800 --> 34:38.440
You got it.

358
35:23.480 --> 35:24.199
I thought

359
35:24.280 --> 35:26.199
you could stay undercover,

360
35:27.280 --> 35:29.119
but things took an unexpected turn.

361
35:30.840 --> 35:32.280
After planning for so long,

362
35:34.199 --> 35:35.559
things still went wrong.

363
35:36.320 --> 35:37.400
No one expected

364
35:37.719 --> 35:40.320
Ma Jingrong to hire Qin Mu for a hit.

365
35:43.719 --> 35:45.199
Since it's come to this,

366
35:47.280 --> 35:50.440
your undercover mission ends now.

367
35:54.840 --> 35:55.519
Captain Bai,

368
35:56.519 --> 35:59.599
I think sticking with Four-Legged Snake

369
35:59.719 --> 36:01.079
can still get me close to Piyazi.

370
36:01.519 --> 36:03.199
No, it's too dangerous.

371
36:04.000 --> 36:05.199
What kind of man Piyazi is,

372
36:05.360 --> 36:06.400
you know better than I do.

373
36:06.760 --> 36:08.519
For profit and to cover his tracks,

374
36:08.679 --> 36:10.000
he'd kill even his own people.

375
36:10.239 --> 36:11.880
Not to mention Piyazi's brother

376
36:11.880 --> 36:13.679
died while he was with you.

377
36:14.199 --> 36:15.480
He will never let you off the hook.

378
36:15.639 --> 36:16.800
Operation Thunderbolt

379
36:16.960 --> 36:18.800
has come this far with great effort.

380
36:19.119 --> 36:20.559
We've sacrificed so much

381
36:20.719 --> 36:22.119
to get to this stage.

382
36:22.960 --> 36:24.480
I can't let my own safety

383
36:24.599 --> 36:25.840
ruin the whole operation.

384
36:26.280 --> 36:28.760
You know how dangerous undercover work is.

385
36:29.079 --> 36:30.400
I want you to stay alive.

386
36:30.719 --> 36:31.599
But if I don't go—

387
36:31.760 --> 36:32.760
No buts.

388
36:38.519 --> 36:40.599
Our investigation into Piyazi won't stop,

389
36:40.760 --> 36:42.480
and Operation Thunderbolt will continue.

390
36:42.639 --> 36:43.360
Do you understand?

391
36:45.039 --> 36:46.360
Ma Jingrong hired a hitman.

392
36:46.519 --> 36:48.239
Piyazi definitely won't spare him.

393
36:48.400 --> 36:50.440
I know you planted someone with Ma Jingrong,

394
36:50.440 --> 36:51.039
but...

395
36:51.239 --> 36:52.800
That makes it even more crucial

396
36:52.960 --> 36:55.280
to infiltrate Piyazi's ring for intel.

397
36:58.880 --> 37:00.119
A cross-border undercover mission is too risky.

398
37:00.280 --> 37:01.639
I have to report to higher-ups first.

399
37:03.480 --> 37:05.719
I know going with Four-Legged Snake to see Piyazi

400
37:06.320 --> 37:07.519
carries immense danger.

401
37:07.760 --> 37:09.039
But I am a police officer.

402
37:09.559 --> 37:11.360
Captain Bai, I'm your comrade.

403
37:12.960 --> 37:14.360
You have to trust me.

404
37:15.079 --> 37:16.679
I can get the job done.

405
37:29.559 --> 37:30.840
It's a call from Four-Legged Snake.

406
37:31.639 --> 37:32.599
You're my superior.

407
37:32.960 --> 37:35.800
I need your approval to continue the operation.

408
38:00.199 --> 38:01.960
Brother Four, where are you?

409
38:03.199 --> 38:04.960
Alright, see you in a bit.

410
38:13.159 --> 38:13.800
Captain Bai.

411
38:15.280 --> 38:16.159
I'm heading out.

412
38:18.800 --> 38:19.639
Wei Kai.

413
38:21.079 --> 38:22.679
Once the operation is over,

414
38:27.360 --> 38:29.639
I want to see you in your uniform,

415
38:31.559 --> 38:33.119
standing in front of me.

416
39:12.920 --> 39:13.679
Where's Brother Nan?

417
39:16.599 --> 39:17.960
I asked you, where's Brother Nan?

418
39:19.800 --> 39:21.480
Brother Nan is dead.

419
39:23.039 --> 39:23.760
What?

420
39:24.719 --> 39:26.199
Brother Nan is dead.

421
39:26.360 --> 39:28.239
I clearly saw the two of you get out together!

422
39:28.599 --> 39:30.599
We did break through the police blockade,

423
39:31.239 --> 39:33.800
but we ran into a bunch of gunmen on the road.

424
39:33.960 --> 39:36.000
What? What gunmen?

425
39:38.199 --> 39:39.519
Those guys came out of the cargo hold

426
39:39.519 --> 39:40.320
and tailed us.

427
39:40.480 --> 39:42.119
They shot Brother Nan dead.

428
39:42.599 --> 39:43.320
Who were they?

429
39:44.119 --> 39:45.079
Who were they?!

430
39:45.239 --> 39:47.320
I don't know. I've never seen them before.

431
39:51.199 --> 39:52.840
But they looked like they were from Country M.

432
39:53.519 --> 39:54.960
If I'm not mistaken,

433
39:55.519 --> 39:57.440
Ma Jingrong hired them to do it.

434
39:58.920 --> 40:00.480
Ma Jingrong?

435
40:11.360 --> 40:12.440
Now that things have blown up like this,

436
40:12.480 --> 40:14.079
the cops are definitely looking everywhere for us.

437
40:14.639 --> 40:17.639
Before, we could still lay low in Country M,

438
40:18.519 --> 40:20.000
but now Brother Nan is dead.

439
40:32.960 --> 40:33.639
Brother Nan.

440
40:34.599 --> 40:37.519
I kept telling you to go back to Country M,

441
40:37.519 --> 40:39.199
but you just wouldn't listen.

442
40:40.599 --> 40:42.719
You insisted on avenging our brothers,

443
40:43.920 --> 40:46.599
and called me, Four-Legged Snake, a coward.

444
40:48.840 --> 40:51.280
So much for my good intentions.

445
40:51.639 --> 40:52.920
Just as I expected,

446
40:53.480 --> 40:54.559
you got taken out.

447
40:55.400 --> 40:57.760
You're Brother Dong's favorite little brother.

448
40:57.920 --> 40:58.840
Now that you're gone,

449
40:59.159 --> 41:01.559
how can I explain this to Brother Dong?

450
41:01.840 --> 41:03.079
All we can do is go to Country M

451
41:04.000 --> 41:06.480
and explain it to Brother Dong in person.

452
41:08.360 --> 41:10.679
Unless we have another choice.

453
41:17.679 --> 41:19.639
What other choice could I have?

454
41:20.559 --> 41:24.000
If I don't explain this clearly to Brother Dong,

455
41:30.199 --> 41:32.599
I'll be on the run for the rest of my life.

456
41:41.599 --> 41:43.199
None of Ma Jingrong's past downline buyers

457
41:43.480 --> 41:44.400
has ever been able

458
41:44.559 --> 41:46.320
to move hundreds of millions in cargo yearly.

459
41:46.880 --> 41:48.199
That's why he reached out to Cheng Weimin.

460
41:49.280 --> 41:50.800
Now that Cheng Weimin has been caught,

461
41:51.079 --> 41:53.159
Ma Jingrong can't answer to Theerade.

462
41:54.280 --> 41:55.920
Then Theerade could easily cast him aside.

463
41:56.159 --> 41:58.239
Unless we find him a capable

464
41:58.400 --> 41:59.559
and influential downline buyer.

465
41:59.920 --> 42:01.639
Otherwise, all our planning

466
42:01.800 --> 42:02.960
will have been in vain.

467
42:05.199 --> 42:07.039
I think this is actually our chance.

468
42:07.199 --> 42:08.760
If Theerade's downline buyer

469
42:08.920 --> 42:10.440
happens to be one of our own,

470
42:10.599 --> 42:11.840
then in future operations,

471
42:12.000 --> 42:13.840
we'll hold far more initiative.

472
42:14.639 --> 42:16.920
Ma Jingrong is suspicious by nature.

473
42:17.199 --> 42:18.480
If we suddenly

474
42:18.679 --> 42:20.400
bring in such a major buyer for him,

475
42:20.760 --> 42:22.000
he'll definitely get suspicious.

476
42:22.880 --> 42:24.159
A downline buyer...

477
42:25.639 --> 42:26.639
How about this?

478
42:27.840 --> 42:29.079
We set them up with

479
42:29.239 --> 42:30.599
a drug dealer who actually exists.

480
42:34.239 --> 42:35.719
Earlier, the Zhuwan Narcotics Detachment

481
42:35.760 --> 42:36.840
in a covert operation

482
42:37.000 --> 42:38.960
captured a drug dealer named Shen Xinru.

483
42:39.719 --> 42:42.079
This dealer is infamous in the drug trade,

484
42:42.280 --> 42:43.360
but his movements are elusive.

485
42:43.519 --> 42:45.239
Few people know what he actually looks like.

486
42:46.320 --> 42:47.599
You mean

487
42:48.280 --> 42:50.800
have someone pose as Shen Xinru?

488
42:51.480 --> 42:53.199
Theerade will surely use other channels

489
42:53.440 --> 42:55.159
to check Ma Jingrong's downline buyer.

490
42:55.280 --> 42:56.760
If we want him to take the bait,

491
42:57.800 --> 42:59.519
we could find someone

492
42:59.639 --> 43:01.360
who shares Shen Xinru's physical features.

493
43:04.320 --> 43:05.719
You know the case files inside out.

494
43:06.639 --> 43:09.000
Thanks to you keeping me off the field, Captain Bai.

495
43:11.400 --> 43:13.239
I need to run this by higher-ups.

496
43:13.800 --> 43:14.760
Wait for my word.

497
43:16.320 --> 43:16.960
Alright.
